Website: {{ $('Assess Result').first().json.domain }}
What the business does: {{ $('Assess Result').first().json.business || 'unknown (judge from the domain name only and be cautious)' }}
Its services: {{ ($('Assess Result').first().json.services || []).join(', ') || 'unknown' }}
Market: {{ $('Assess Result').first().json.country }}
Keyword: "{{ $('Assess Result').first().json.keyword }}"
Search intent from keyword data: {{ $('Assess Result').first().json.intent || 'unknown' }}
